        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/place/Killeen"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Killeen grew into a military boomtown when Camp Hood—now Fort Cavazos—was established nearby (source 7, 12).",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Killeen%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fort Hood was renamed Fort Cavazos in 2023, marking the latest change in the area’s military heritage (source 6).",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
